##			- Bare 'help'/'version' words work; -y/--yes aliases for -q; usage errors drop the call-stack line.
##			- fIsAhead stops at the first commit; tag lookup via mapfile instead of a head pipeline.
##		- 20260724 JC:
##			- Added clone (get an existing repo; checks out dev if it has one; re-run is a no-op) and connect (publish local work: init if needed, commit, then push to an empty remote - or create the GitHub repo via gh for owner/name targets; --public/--private pick visibility).
##			- connect refuses remotes that already have history and won't change an existing origin; both new commands preview and confirm like everything else.
##		- 20260725 JC:
